# Egress allow-list (extended regex, host-matched). FilterDefaultDeny=Yes, so
# ONLY hosts matching a line here are reachable; everything else is refused.
# The agent reaches the Anthropic API and nothing else on the internet
# (portitor is on the internal network, not via this proxy).
#
# This is the image's baked DEFAULT (a bare `docker run egress-proxy` uses
# it). Per-instance stacks REPLACE it wholesale by bind-mounting
# $CONFIG_DIR/egress-filter over this path; faber-stack generates that file from
# its --allow hosts, one anchored `^host$` line each. Keep this default minimal.
^api\.anthropic\.com$
